WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:34.292
Jemima Puddle-Duck was upset.

2
00:00:34.293 --> 00:00:38.693
"I don't like the farmer's wife," she said.

3
00:00:38.694 --> 00:00:42.717
"Why?" asked her sister, Rebecca.

4
00:00:42.718 --> 00:00:47.144
"She took my eggs!" cried Jemima.

5
00:00:47.145 --> 00:00:56.750
"She gave them to the hens to hatch!"

6
00:00:56.751 --> 00:00:59.774
This was true.

7
00:00:59.775 --> 00:01:06.545
The farmer's wife took all the ducks' eggs.

8
00:01:06.546 --> 00:01:09.413
But Rebecca didn't mind.

9
00:01:09.414 --> 00:01:15.126
"I'm glad she took my eggs," said Rebecca.

10
00:01:15.127 --> 00:01:21.836
"I don't have time to sit on them."

11
00:01:21.837 --> 00:01:25.321
Jemima was still upset.

12
00:01:25.322 --> 00:01:31.262
"I want to hatch my own eggs," she said.

13
00:01:31.263 --> 00:01:35.149
"That's silly," said Rebecca.

14
00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:37.663
"You would get bored.

15
00:01:37.664 --> 00:01:42.015
Then you'd forget about your eggs."

16
00:01:42.016 --> 00:01:54.525
Jemima didn't listen.

17
00:01:54.526 --> 00:01:58.395
She tried to hide her eggs.

18
00:01:58.396 --> 00:02:02.928
She hid them all over the farm.

19
00:02:02.929 --> 00:02:10.445
She hid them in an onion patch.

20
00:02:10.446 --> 00:02:14.909
She hid them behind some pots.

21
00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:39.034
She hid them under a bucket.

22
00:02:39.035 --> 00:02:58.173
But the farmer's wife always found them.

23
00:02:58.174 --> 00:03:03.851
Jemima stomped her foot.

24
00:03:03.852 --> 00:03:07.132
"That's it," she said.

25
00:03:07.133 --> 00:03:10.721
"I am leaving this farm.

26
00:03:10.722 --> 00:03:14.498
I'll lay my eggs in another place.

27
00:03:14.499 --> 00:03:22.005
And then I'll hatch them!"
